<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>🔥 FIRE ON TARGET</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0a0a0f;
            --card: #111118;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --accent: #ff0040;
            --accent2: #ff6b00;
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #4a5568;
            --success: #00ffa3;
            --error: #ff4d6d;
            --input-bg: #1a1a2e;
            --glow: rgba(255,0,64,0.2);
            --shadow-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            --font-mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            --font-bangla: 'Noto Sans Bengali', sans-serif;
            --btn-color: #ff0040;
        }
        * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: var(--bg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: var(--font-bangla);
            position: relative;
            padding: 15px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 20%, rgba(255,0,64,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 80%, rgba(255,107,0,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
        }
        .devtools-blocker {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: #0a0a0f;
            z-index: 999999;
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ff0040;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .devtools-blocker.active { display: flex; }
        .devtools-blocker i { font-size: 60px; color: #ff6b00; }
        .loading-screen {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: var(--bg);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 10000;
            transition: opacity 0.4s ease, visibility 0.4s ease;
        }
        .loading-screen.hidden { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
        .circle-loader-wrap { position: relative; width: 140px; height: 140px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .circle-ring { position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid transparent; border-top: 3px solid #ff0040; border-right: 3px solid #ff6b00; animation: spin 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.5, 1) infinite; }
        .circle-ring-2 { position: absolute; inset: 12px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid transparent; border-bottom: 3px solid #00ffa3; border-left: 3px solid #ff4d6d; animation: spin 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.5, 1) infinite reverse; }
        .circle-ring-3 { position: absolute; inset: 26px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; border-top: 2px solid #fbbf24; border-right: 2px solid #ff0040; animation: spin 1s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.5, 1) infinite; }
        .circle-center { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .circle-emoji { font-size: 36px; animation: emojiPulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
        @keyframes emojiPulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.1); } }
        .circle-percent { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #ff0040; margin-top: 2px; }
        @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .loader-text { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); letter-spacing: 0.2em; margin-bottom: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .loader-sub { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .loader-dots { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
        .loader-dots span { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff0040; animation: dotBounce 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
        .loader-dots span:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
        .loader-dots span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
        .loader-dots span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        @keyframes dotBounce { 0%, 80%, 100% { transform: scale(0.4); opacity: 0.3; } 40% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }
        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
            background: rgba(17, 17, 24, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,0,64,0.2);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 28px 22px 22px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 40px rgba(255,0,64,0.05);
            animation: slideIn 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            -moz-user-select: none;
            -ms-user-select: none;
            user-select: none;
        }
        @keyframes slideIn { from { opacity:0; transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.95); } to { opacity:1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }
        .card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 30px; right: 30px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ff0040, #ff6b00, transparent); }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .logo-wrap { width: 75px; height: 75px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,0,64,0.15), rgba(255,107,0,0.15)); border: 2px solid rgba(255,0,64,0.3); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 10px; font-size: 34px; animation: glowPulse 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
        @keyframes glowPulse { 0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255,0,64,0.2); } 50% { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(255,0,64,0.4), 0 0 90px rgba(255,107,0,0.2); } }
        .site-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0040, #ff6b00); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .site-sub { font-size: 11px; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: #ff6b00; letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-top: 5px; opacity: 0.85; -webkit-text-fill-color: #ff6b00; }
        .field { margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .field-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 10px; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .field-label i { color: #ff0040; font-size: 12px; }
        .input-wrapper { position: relative; }
        .input-wrapper input { width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; padding-right: 44px; background: var(--input-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); outline: none; transition: all 0.3s; }
        .input-wrapper input:focus { border-color: #ff0040; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,0,64,0.12); }
        .input-wrapper input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); opacity: 0.5; font-size: 13px; }
        .input-icon { position: absolute; right: 14px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
        .attack-btn { width: 100%; padding: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--btn-color) 0%, var(--accent2) 100%); border: none; border-radius: 14px; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255,0,64,0.3); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .attack-btn::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 60%, transparent 80%); pointer-events: none; }
        .attack-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(255,0,64,0.5); }
        .attack-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.7; cursor: not-allowed; }
        .btn-content { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; }
        .btn-spinner { display: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-top-color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; animation: spinBtn 0.8s linear infinite; }
        @keyframes spinBtn { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .attack-btn:disabled .btn-spinner { display: block; }
        .attack-btn:disabled .btn-icon { display: none; }
        .progress-section { display: none; margin-top: 18px; padding: 16px 14px; background: rgba(255,0,64,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,0,64,0.1); border-radius: 14px; }
        .progress-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .progress-title { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
        .progress-percent { font-size: 13px; color: #ff0040; font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-mono); }
        .progress-track { height: 5px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; }
        .progress-fill { height: 100%; width: 0%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff0040, #ff6b00); border-radius: 99px; transition: width 0.5s; }
        .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; margin-top: 12px; }
        .stat-item { text-align: center; padding: 8px 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
        .stat-value { font-size: 22px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
        .stat-value.success { color: var(--success); }
        .stat-value.error { color: var(--error); }
        .stat-value.accent { color: #ff6b00; }
        .ad-banner { margin-top: 14px; padding: 10px 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; min-height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: 0.03em; transition: all 0.3s; backdrop-filter: blur(5px); }
        .ad-banner:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border-color: rgba(255,0,64,0.08); }
        .ad-banner .ad-placeholder { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; opacity: 0.5; color: var(--muted); }
        .ad-banner .ad-placeholder i { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,0,64,0.3); }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 18px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
        .footer-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .footer-text { font-size: 9px; color: #374151; font-family: var(--font-mono); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .live-dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; background: var(--success); border-radius: 50%; animation: blink 1.5s infinite; }
        @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.3} }
        .social-links { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        .social-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 25px; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 9px; font-family: var(--font-mono); transition: all 0.3s; }
        .social-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .social-link i { font-size: 13px; }
        .social-link.fb:hover { border-color: #1877f2; color: #1877f2; }
        .social-link.wa:hover { border-color: #25D366; color: #25D366; }
        .social-link.tg:hover { border-color: #0088cc; color: #0088cc; }
        .grid-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }
        .popup-overlay { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); display: none; justify-content: center; align-items: center; z-index: 9999; }
        .popup-overlay.active { display: flex; }
        .popup-box { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111118, #1a1a2e); border: 1px solid rgba(255,0,64,0.3); border-radius: 28px; padding: 30px 24px; max-width: 400px; width: 90%; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); animation: popIn 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1); }
        @keyframes popIn { from { opacity:0; transform: scale(0.8) translateY(40px); } to { opacity:1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); } }
        .popup-icon { font-size: 50px; display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .popup-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ff0040; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .popup-content { font-family: var(--font-bangla); font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .popup-divider { width: 50px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ff0040, transparent); margin: 16px auto; }
        .popup-btn { padding: 12px 35px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0040, #ff6b00); border: none; border-radius: 30px; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; }
        .popup-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }

        /* লক পপআপ */
        .lock-popup-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            display: none;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 99999;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .lock-popup-overlay.active { display: flex; }
        .lock-popup-box {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111118, #1a1a2e);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,107,0,0.4);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 35px 25px;
            max-width: 380px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 60px rgba(255,107,0,0.1);
            animation: popIn 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
        }
        .lock-popup-icon { font-size: 60px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .lock-popup-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #ff6b00; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .lock-popup-sub { font-family: var(--font-bangla); font-size: 15px; color: #b0c4de; line-height: 1.8; }
        .lock-popup-timer { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #ff0040; margin: 12px 0; }
        .lock-popup-close { margin-top: 16px; padding: 10px 35px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0040, #ff6b00); border: none; border-radius: 30px; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; }
        .lock-popup-close:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }

        /* জয়েন পপআপ */
        .join-popup-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            display: none;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 99998;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .join-popup-overlay.active { display: flex; }
        .join-popup-box {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111118, #1a1a2e);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,0,64,0.3);
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 35px 25px 25px;
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 60px rgba(255,0,64,0.1);
            animation: popIn 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .join-popup-box::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ff0040, #ff6b00, transparent); }
        .join-popup-icon { font-size: 55px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .join-popup-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ff0040; margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
        .join-popup-sub { font-family: var(--font-bangla); font-size: 14px; color: #b0c4de; line-height: 1.8; }
        .join-popup-highlight { background: rgba(255,0,64,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,0,64,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px; margin: 14px 0 18px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: #ff6b00; word-break: break-all; }
        .join-popup-highlight i { color: #ff0040; margin-right: 6px; }
        .join-btn-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .join-btn {
            padding: 14px; border: none; border-radius: 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff;
        }
        .join-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0088cc, #006699); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,136,204,0.3); }
        .join-btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,136,204,0.5); }
        .join-btn-primary i { font-size: 18px; }
        .join-btn-secondary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0040, #ff6b00); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255,0,64,0.3); }
        .join-btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){ transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(255,0,64,0.5); }
        .join-btn-secondary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }
        .join-popup-divider { width: 50px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #ff0040, transparent); margin: 12px auto; }
        .join-status-text { font-size: 10px; color: #6b7b9f; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 6px; min-height: 16px; }
        .join-status-text.success { color: #00ffa3; }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .card { padding: 20px 14px 16px; }
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 4px; }
            .stat-value { font-size: 18px; }
            .circle-loader-wrap { width: 110px; height: 110px; }
            .circle-emoji { font-size: 26px; }
            .circle-percent { font-size: 12px; }
            .loader-text { font-size: 13px; }
            .site-title { font-size: 18px; }
            .logo-wrap { width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 28px; }
            .input-wrapper input { padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13px; }
            .social-links { gap: 8px; }
            .social-link { padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 8px; }
            .ad-banner { min-height: 38px; font-size: 9px; padding: 8px 10px; }
            .lock-popup-timer { font-size: 26px; }
            .join-popup-box { padding: 25px 18px 18px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 380px) {
            .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .stat-value { font-size: 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="devtools-blocker" id="devtoolsBlocker">
    <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
    <span>🔐 নিরাপত্তা সতর্কতা</span>
    <small style="font-size:14px;opacity:0.6;">ডেভেলপার টুল খোলা থাকলে এই পৃষ্ঠা কাজ করবে না</small>
</div>

<div class="loading-screen" id="loadingScreen">
    <div class="circle-loader-wrap">
        <div class="circle-ring"></div>
        <div class="circle-ring-2"></div>
        <div class="circle-ring-3"></div>
        <div class="circle-center">
            <span class="circle-emoji">🔥</span>
            <span class="circle-percent" id="circlePercent">0%</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="loader-text" id="loaderText">INITIALIZING</div>
    <div class="loader-sub" id="loaderSub">⚡ Booting up system...</div>
    <div class="loader-dots">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="grid-bg"></div>

<!-- ===== JOIN POPUP ===== -->
<div class="join-popup-overlay" id="joinPopup">
    <div class="join-popup-box">
        <span class="join-popup-icon">🔥</span>
        <div class="join-popup-title">FIRE ON TARGET</div>
        <div class="join-popup-sub">অ্যাপ ব্যবহার করতে আমাদের টেলিগ্রাম চ্যানেলে জয়েন করুন!</div>
        <div class="join-popup-highlight"><i class="fas fa-link"></i> t.me/project_xx7</div>
        <div class="join-btn-group">
            <a href="https://t.me/project_xx7" target="_blank" class="join-btn join-btn-primary" id="joinChannelBtn"><i class="fab fa-telegram-plane"></i> চ্যানেলে জয়েন করো</a>
            <button class="join-btn join-btn-secondary" id="continueBtn" disabled><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> এগিয়ে যাও</button>
